0:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_监管</source><category>通信与算力</category></item><item><title>工信部：加快制造业中试建设 布局AI、量子科技等关键领域</title><link>https://www.c114.com.cn/news/550/a1300198.html</link><description>今日，工信部发布《关于进一步加快制造业中试平台体系化布局和高水平建设的通知》，旨在落实《制造业中试创新发展实施意见》，进一步推进制造业中试平台体系化布局，加强高水平中试平台建设。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">a9c88baa97ba</guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T08:28:42.169076+00:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_监管</source><category>科研进展</category></item><item><title>工信部：2027年基本建成全域覆盖、高效畅通的城域毫秒级算力网络体系</title><link>https://www.c114.com.cn/news/550/a1298868.html</link><description>颜翊）为落实《算力基础设施高质量发展行动计划》要求，提升算力高效运载能力，切实推动算网融合发展，现组织开展城域“毫秒用算”专项行动，工业和信息化部办公厅近日正式印发《关于开展城域“毫秒用算”专项行动的通知》，在全国范围内梯次推进毫秒用算网络建设，明确到2027年基本形成全域覆盖、高效畅通的城域毫秒用算网络能力体系。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">4aa35ec0cf87</guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T08:28:42.169076+00:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_监管</source><category>通信与算力</category></item><item><title>工信部等七部门：按需布局算力基础设施 加速算力与行业融合应用</title><link>https://www.c114.com.cn/news/550/a1298426.html</link><description>方案还强调夯实服务型制造发展底座，要求深化“5G+工业互联网”融合创新和规模化应用，按需布局算力基础设施，加速算力与行业融合应用。提升工业数据要素供给，推动数据资源化、资产化和要素化，建设一批高质量行业数据集。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">8537937955ce</guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T08:28:42.169076+00:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_监管</source><category>通信与算力</category></item><item><title>销售费用涨61%跑赢营收，影石创新的“营销幻觉”还能持续多久？</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-09/ART-250003-12003-30702714.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">53871295377b</guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T08:28:42.169076+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>产业与资本</category></item><item><title>跌破100元，市场开始重估影石</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-09/ART-250003-8420-30702675.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">3887efcb34b1</guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T08:28:42.169076+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>其他</category></item><item><title>影石创新收入大增利润暴跌：股价今年腰斩超五成，被下调盈利预测</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-09/ART-250003-12004-30702442.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">1b9098080af2</guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T08:28:42.169076+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>其他</category></item><item><title>营收增长50%与净利下滑94%：影石创新的"战略性亏损"还能持续多久？</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-09/ART-250003-12003-30702048.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">a472d11b6818</guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T08:28:42.169076+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>产业与资本</category></item><item><title>最新议程出炉！2026中国激光产业高质量发展峰会即将开启</title><link>https://laser.ofweek.com/2026-07/ART-8100-2400-30694578.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">76b6cb50406a</guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T08:28:42.169076+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 激光频道</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>第27届中国国际光电博览会开展首日盛况空前，“光 + AI”激活光电全产业链新动能</title><link>https://laser.ofweek.com/2026-09/ART-8100-2400-30702419.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">270c3117a284</guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T08:28:42.169076+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 激光频道</source><category>产业与资本</category></item><item><title>AI赋能光电新变革，第27届CIOE中国光博会9月深圳举办聚力全链创新</title><link>https://laser.ofweek.com/2026-08/ART-8100-2400-30701091.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">5b2a5ad5b963</guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T08:28:42.169076+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 激光频道</source><category>通信与算力</category></item><item><title>一周热点：光博会开幕，光通信、近眼显示热度火爆</title><link>https://www.ledinside.cn/news/20260911-62537.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">f1d0190ac466</guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T08:28:42.169076+00:00</pubDate><source>LEDinside 中文</source><category>光通信</category></item><item><title>大招齐发，英特尔直击网络转型</title><link>http://www.c114.com.cn/topic/5096/a996852.html?utm_medium=C114&amp;dclid=CLmNp8bEwdICFRwhKgodT4YHqQ</link><description>运营商是实现5G连接及应用和业务创新的重要基石，也是网络转型的主角。作为中国三大运营商之一的中国电信，正在努力推进网络转型，为5G的到来做好准备。中国电信选择与英特尔合作，采用英特尔RSD实施方案，联手击破运营商在网络转型中的各个难题，真正做到在网络转型之路所向披靡。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">9bd21e8c07b0</guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T08:28:42.169076+00:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_要闻精选</source><category>通信与算力</category></item><item><title>对话英特尔：产业协作与标准化助推5G成功</title><link>http://www.c114.net/news/138/a996926.html</link><description>5G不仅仅是为了手机而设计的，更多的是用于未来的智慧城市、智能家居以及VR等场景。在这个过程中，英特尔和产业合作伙伴也需要不断地学习，从测试当中不断地学习和调整技术和解决方案。英特尔扮演着独特的贡献的角色，通过前期测试当中不断吸取经验和教训，来反馈到标准化的制定当中，让更多的产业合作伙伴受益。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">bd6510b7d1b3</guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T08:28:42.169076+00:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_要闻精选</source><category>产业与资本</category></item><item><title>英特尔助力电信网络转型 让5G不再是“看上去很美”</title><link>http://www.c114.net/topic/5096/a996887.html</link><description>实现5G愿景，可并不仅仅是从基站到手机终端那点事。对无线技术进行革新，只是5G万里长征中的一段路。虽然对于普通消费者而言，这是他们未来能够从手机端看到的变革，但更多他们看不到的变化——电信运营商网络的转型。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">fec6dba9c1c2</guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T08:28:42.169076+00:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_要闻精选</source><category>通信与算力</category></item><item><title>[News] Marelli and Microchip pioneer open-standard display connectivity solution for software-defined vehicles</title><link>//www.ledinside.com/news/2026/9/2026_09_09_04</link><description>Marelli, a global automotive supplier, and Microchip Technology, a broadline supplier of semiconductors committed to making innovative design easier through total system solutions, today announced a new solution that enables graphics and video content generated by a vehicle's central computer to be streamed directly to automotive displays using ASA Motion Link (ASA-ML), an open standard for automotive video connectivity. The demonstrator of this solution helps vehicle makers simplify display arc</description><guid isPermaLink="false">346caf55aba7</guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T08:28:42.169076+00:00</pubDate><source>LEDinside 英文</source><category>显示与面板</category></item></channel></rss>